color_scheme":"scheme-5","eyebrow":"WHY YUMMYBARA","heading":"The only baby snack built for your child's age. Not just free from the worst.","heading_accent":"","body_text":"<p>Most baby snacks compete on what they remove. Yummybara is built on what it puts in - and how. StageWise™ is Singapore's first<strong> age-calibrated functional snacking system<\/strong>, combining melt-on-contact texture, integrated pre + probiotics, freeze-dried nutrition lock, and developmental-stage formulation.<\/p>","cta_label":"","cta_url":"","image_1":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/hltone_home_page.svg","image_2":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/hltone_home_page_2.webp","image_3":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/hltone_home_page_1.webp","mobile_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/ImageWithFallback_5.webp","testimonial_quote":"Absolutely love the quality and attention to detail. Best purchase I've made this year!","testimonial_author":"Sarah M.","feature_1_title":"Trusted by parents","feature_1_text":"Loved by little ones (quickly eaten)","feature_1_icon":"heart","feature_2_title":"Age Appropriate formulas","feature_2_text":"Nutrients designed for each age groups.","feature_2_icon":"leaf","feature_3_title":"Convenient & mess-free","feature_3_text":"Easy to take on the go, fits any moment","feature_3_icon":"airplane","feature_4_title":"No nasties, ever","feature_4_text":"Clean label, full ingredient transparency","feature_4_icon":"star"},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["ai_gen_block_cff5c3b_U3VXT6"],"name":"Why Yummy Bara","settings":{}},"177989967348d58764":{"type":"_blocks","blocks":{"ai_gen_block_736a5e4_DYAWHQ":{"type":"ai_gen_block_736a5e4","settings":{"layout":"image_left","container_width":1200,"desktop_width_percent":100,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/ImageWithFallback.webp","image_border_radius":12,"image_caption":"<p><em>\"Yummybara's StageWise™ system is the most thoughtful approach to infant snacking I've reviewed. The age-specific nutrient calibration and melt-on-contact texture address two of the most common early-feeding concerns - choking risk and nutritional adequacy - in a single product.\"<\/em><br\/><br\/><strong>Dr. Siti Norzaimah, RD<\/strong><br\/>Registered Dietitian · Paediatric Nutrition Specialist<\/p>","show_icon":true,"icon_size":18,"caption_size":14,"caption_alignment":"center","subheading":"Our Story","subheading_size":14,"heading":"Born from a mum's frustration with the snack aisle.","heading_size":40,"story_text":"<p>Yummybara started in 2022 when our founder - a first-time mum in Singapore - spent weeks reading every label in the baby snack aisle. What she found: most products competed on what they removed. None were built around what a developing 6-month-old body actually needs.<\/p><p>Working with Singapore-based food scientists and a registered paediatric dietitian, she built <strong>StageWise™<\/strong> - a functional snacking system that integrates melt-on-contact safety, pre + probiotic gut support, freeze-dried nutrition lock, and age-calibrated formulation into every snack.<\/p><p>Every batch is third-party tested. Every ingredient serves a developmental purpose. Every product is formulated for a specific age - not rounded to the nearest milestone.<\/p>","text_size":16,"show_cards":true,"card_1_title":"2022","card_1_text":"Founded in SG","card_2_title":"3rd party","card_2_text":"Lab tested batches","card_3_title":"RD-reviewed","card_3_text":"Every formulation","card_title_size":18,"card_text_size":14,"card_border_radius":12,"card_border_thickness":1,"button_text":"Learn more","button_link":"","button_border_radius":40,"background_color":"#eef6fc","subheading_color":"#2b7b99","heading_color":"#1b2e5c","text_color":"#4b7796","caption_color":"#55679f","icon_color":"#5ec2e7","card_background_color":"#ffffff","card_border_color":"#ffffff","card_title_color":"#1b2e5c","card_text_color":"#55679f","button_background_color":"#192e59","button_text_color":"#f2efdd","button_hover_background_color":"#3f4e1f","padding_top":64,"padding_bottom":64},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["ai_gen_block_736a5e4_DYAWHQ"],"name":"Our story","settings":{}},"1779987407e7b8cced":{"type":"_blocks","blocks":{"ai_gen_block_6020e05_wAUgCT":{"type":"ai_gen_block_6020e05","settings":{"subheading":"The Science","heading":"How <em>StageWise™ engineers every snack <\/em>for a growing body.","subheading_size":14,"heading_size":40,"subheading_color":"#8abadb","heading_color":"#f7eab9","card_1_icon":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/a0fd13ea-032a-404c-9e54-39510673fa34.webp","card_1_title":"Melt-on-Contact Texture (aka GentleMelt)","card_1_text":"Freeze-dried structure dissolves instantly on contact with saliva. No choking risk, no gumming required. Safe from 6 months.","card_2_icon":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/e418d6e8-d3dd-4594-8b60-16b5500b880c.webp","card_2_title":"Pre + Probiotics Inside","card_2_text":"Integrated prebiotics and probiotics - not added as an afterthought. Supports the developing gut microbiome from the very first snack.","card_3_icon":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/cc4c510a-5809-421e-971a-92c7fc4eb09b.webp","card_3_title":"Freeze-Dried Nutrition Lock","card_3_text":"Retaining up to 97% of original vitamins, minerals & antioxidants. Freeze-drying preserves what conventional processing destroys.","card_4_icon":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/ChatGPT_Image_Jun_2_2026_10_25_55_PM.webp","card_4_title":"Age-Specific Formulation","card_4_text":"Designed for 6m+, 12m+, and 18m+ - not a one-size-fits-all formula. Nutrients calibrated to each developmental stage.","card_5_icon":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/08f8ec33-c635-43dd-b7dd-2838496bcbf9.webp","card_5_title":"Clean Ingredients","card_5_text":"No fillers, gums, or unnecessary additives. No added refined sugar, no salt, no preservatives. Only what belongs.","icon_size":40,"card_gap":20,"card_title_size":18,"card_text_size":14,"card_background":"#eef6fc","card_title_color":"#1b2e5c","card_text_color":"#4b7796","card_border_radius":12,"background_color":"#1b2e5c","desktop_width_percent":100},"bl