#1b2e5c","card_text_color":"#394a82","card_subtext_color":"#5ec2e7","card_title_size":20,"card_subtitle_size":16,"card_text_size":15,"card_subtext_size":13,"card_1_title":"★★★★★","card_1_subtitle":"\"Our house only has HLT One snacks now.\"","card_1_text":"<p>Trust me, my house only has HLT One snacks now. No more other biscuits. We used to buy fish or animal biscuits and ended up stopping. We changed everything to HLT.<\/p>","card_1_subtext":"Verified Customer · via WhatsApp","card_2_title":"★★★★★","card_2_subtitle":"\"Baby loves it so much I had to find it online.\"","card_2_text":"<p>Tastes good even for adults, not too sweet, and melts in the mouth. Baby loves it so much that I had to find it online!<\/p>","card_2_subtext":"Verified Buyer · Shopee","card_3_title":"★★★★★","card_3_subtitle":"\"So crunchy my baby can't get enough.\"","card_3_text":"<p>These are so good and so crunchy! My baby absolutely adores them and just can't get enough. Definitely recommend for parents to refer.<\/p>","card_3_subtext":"Verified Buyer · Shopee","card_4_title":"★★★★★","card_4_subtitle":"\"Just fruit, nothing else.\"","card_4_text":"<p>Easy for a 1-year-old to eat, with no ingredients other than the fruit itself. Love seeing kids enjoy it everyday. Worth recommend!<\/p>","card_4_subtext":"Verified Buyer · Shopee · Mum of 1-year-old","card_5_title":"★★★★","card_5_subtitle":"\"Still crispy days after opening.\"","card_5_text":"<p>He loves it, and it stays crispy even when it's been opened for days, unlike other brands we'd tried, which always got wasted because they couldn't keep.<\/p>","card_5_subtext":"Verified Customer · via WhatsApp","card_6_title":"★★★★★","card_6_subtitle":"\"One of her almost-daily snacks.\"","card_6_text":"<p>I've been ordering this almost every other week with the rate my toddler is going. It's one of her almost-daily snacks! Fast delivery as always.<\/p>","card_6_subtext":"Verified Customer · via Messenger"},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["ai_gen_block_4ef73cd_3pybLg"],"name":"Testimonial","settings":{}},"collapsible_content_UyKD4F":{"type":"collapsible-content","blocks":{"collapsible_row_nJCbdc":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"What age is Yummybara suitable for?","icon":"none","row_content":"<p>Yummybara melts are suitable for babies 6 months and above. Each product is formulated for a specific developmental stage - 6m+, 12m+, and 18m+ - with textures and nutrients calibrated to that stage.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_Ngf6zK":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Are Yummybara snacks Halal certified?","icon":"none","row_content":"<p>Yes! Yummybara is proudly Halal certified. We take this seriously and ensure every product and ingredient meets strict Halal standards, so all families can snack with confidence.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_kCejkn":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"What is StageWise™?","icon":"none","row_content":"<p>StageWise™ is our proprietary functional snacking system - combining melt-on-contact freeze-dried texture (zero choking risk), integrated pre + probiotic gut support, freeze-dried nutrition lock (retaining up to 97% of vitamins), and age-specific formulation. It's not just what we remove. It's what we engineer in.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_j6LMki":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Do your products contain added sugar, salt, or preservatives?","icon":"none","row_content":"<p>No. Yummybara contains no added refined sugar, no added salt, and no preservatives. Sweetness comes from real fruit; flavour comes from whole ingredients. Always.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_bHd9z7":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"How does freeze-drying preserve nutrition?","icon":"none","row_content":"<p>Freeze-drying removes moisture without heat, preserving up to 97% of original vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants. Conventional processing (baking, extruding) uses high heat that degrades much of the nutritional content. Our snacks are nutritionally closer to fresh food than conventional processed baby snacks.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_EDfgwU":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Can I mix flavours in the bundle?","icon":"none","row_content":"<p>Yes of course! Little hands tend to finish them fast! It’s highly recommended to stock up on a family favourite! <\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_hmB8Mw":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Do you deliver island-wide in Singapore?","icon":"none","row_content":"<p>Yes! We offer island-wide delivery across Singapore. Orders are dispatched within 1–2 business days, with delivery in 2–3 business days thereafter. Free delivery on orders above $50.<\/p>","page":""}}},"block_order":["collapsible_row_nJCbdc","collapsible_row_Ngf6zK","collapsible_row_kCejkn","collapsible_row_j6LMki","collapsible_row_bHd9z7","collapsible_row_EDfgwU","collapsible_row_hmB8Mw"],"name":"FAQ","settings":{"caption":"Got Questions","heading":"Frequently asked.","heading_size":"h1","heading_alignment":"center","layout":"none","container_color_scheme":"scheme-2","color_scheme":"scheme-2","open_first_collapsible_row":false,"image_ratio":"adapt","desktop_layout":"image_second","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"1780482698517822a4":{"type":"_blocks","blocks":{"ai_gen_block_91d5e75_qrqCHX":{"type":"ai_gen_block_91d5e75","settings":{"subheading":"READY TO START?","heading":"Gentle snacks for <em>growing<\/em> little tummies.","text":"<p>Join 124+ Singapore parents who trust Yummybara for their baby's first snack moments. Halal certified. Freeze-dried nutrition. No nasties. Just goodness.<\/p>","subtext":"<p><em>🚛  <\/em>Free island-wide delivery on orders above $50 · Ships in 1–2 business days<\/p>","content_alignment":"center","padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":40,"padding_horizontal":20,"subheading_size":14,"subheading_spacing":8,"heading_size":36,"heading_spacing":16,"text_size":16,"text_spacing":24,"subtext_size":14,"background_color"